{
	"name": "Hope’s Light",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-silver-white.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Beseeching all that is good and holy, you plant the banner into the ground and feel the wave of energy roll outward from the banner, casting back evil creatures in its path. When you plant this banner in the ground, it creates a temporary @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.r6eshb9jaeqc70mp]{Hallow} effect that lasts for up to 1 hour. If the effect is dispelled the banner falls to the ground. If the banner is moved from its location by any creature, the effect ends. When you use this ability, you may choose from any of the secondary spell options provided by the Hallow spell.</p><p>This item has 3 charges and recovers 1 charge at dawn. If the last charge is used roll [[/r 1d20]]. On a 1 the banner crumbles to ash at the end of the Hallow duration.</p>",
